about: Tools and utilities for selene.

name: Red Flower
version: Pre-Release 1.0
maintainer: stolefromcloudflare
size: unknown
date: 2024-07-19
url: https://github.com/25freepb/redflower
note: Command line tool for Windows (macOS/Linux coming soon) for Redmi 10/Prime/Note 11 4G (selene/selenes). Track logcat, show device info, download/flash custom MIUI, flash GSI, flash recoveries (TWRP/OFOX), manage packages, ADB and fastboot reboot menus, list partitions/baseband/IMEI, separate partition flashing, backup IMEI (nvram/nvdata), fix dm-verity. Uses Google platform-tools and aria2c. Use at your own risk.
vendor: all

