name: Kaeru
version: unknown
maintainer: R0rt1z2
size: unknown
date: 2026-07-30
url: https://github.com/R0rt1z2/kaeru
note: Arbitrary code execution on MediaTek bootloaders. Spoofs the LK bootloader state (locked) for integrity checks. S Vendor only. Usage: fastboot flash lk kaeru.bin, fastboot oem bldr_spoof on, flash disabled vbmeta files if not MIUI, then use Play Integrity Fix. Download: https://t.me/Redmi10Co/44818
